      "label": "general public",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general public audience, particularly those who are aware of or affected by healthcare systems, medical crises, or scientific progress. It targets individuals who may be skeptical or cynical about the effectiveness of medical science or public health institutions, especially in the context of overwhelming patient loads or pandemics. The message is intended to resonate with people who have experienced or witnessed healthcare system strain, and who may feel disillusioned by claims of scientific advancement.",
